+ *
+ * Moves exported names, verbatim, from their module to another, one (source, names, destination) at
+ * a time, and rewrites every importer. Also the shared library of move.cjs (R1.0.1).
+ *
+ *   node export-move.cjs --root <checkout> [--owners <owners.tsv> | --spec <tsv>] [--from N] [--to N]
+ *   node export-move.cjs --root <checkout> --source <path> --dest <path> --names 'a b old=new'
+ *   node export-move.cjs --print-spec --owners <owners.tsv>       (the spec, from owners.tsv's notes)
+ *   options: --no-git (plain fs renames), --no-lint (skip the import-format pass), --dry (print, write
+ *            nothing), --x <scratch> (the folder of the locks; default the v0.43 scratch folder)
+ *
